This modified version (WWHWarp) includes the following major changes:
- Custom extension library ("Wwh extensions" tab)
- Independent security switches for extensions
- Custom accent themes (orange, brown)
- Custom network request management addon
- Custom translations and branding
- Simplified homepage
- Additional UI panels (security, network)

